#: Source/Editor/Common/Widgets/EditorNetModeCombo.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetMode"
msgid "Net Mode: Standalone plays inside the editor; the other modes launch a separate server and clients (Window > Multiplayer)."
msgstr "Net Mode — Standalone 은 에디터 안에서 재생하고, 나머지는 서버와 클라이언트를 따로 띄운다 (Window > Multiplayer)"

#: Source/Editor/Common/GUI/EditorPlayToolbar.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetPlayClients"
msgid "Connected clients / launched clients. The process list and server pause are in Window > Multiplayer."
msgstr "붙은 클라이언트 / 띄운 클라이언트 — 프로세스 목록 · 서버 일시정지는 Window > Multiplayer"

#: Source/Editor/Common/GUI/EditorPlayToolbar.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetPlayStart"
msgid "Launch a separate server and clients and connect them. Logs gather in the Output Log as [Server] and [Client1], and Stop shuts them all down."
msgstr "서버와 클라이언트를 따로 띄워 붙입니다 — 로그는 Output Log 에 [Server] · [Client1] 로 모이고, Stop 이 모두 끕니다"

#: Source/Editor/Common/GUI/EditorPlayToolbar.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetPlayStop"
msgid "Shut down every process cleanly and, if tracing is on, merge the traces into one file."
msgstr "모든 프로세스를 정상 종료시키고, 트레이스를 켰으면 한 파일로 합칩니다"

#: Source/Editor/Common/Widgets/EditorNetModeCombo.cpp
msgctxt "EdCommon.NetPlayerCount"
msgid "Number of players: the client count for a dedicated server, or the count including the host for a listen host."
msgstr "플레이어 수 — 전용 서버면 클라이언트 수, 리슨 호스트면 호스트를 넣은 수"

